  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level, whenever the envoy uses his dispiriting words ability, he can increase the action cost by one step (swift to move, move to standard, standard to full-round, and full-round to 1 round) or outwit the target as a cost to allow him to affect creatures with his dispiriting words ability regardless of language.</p>\n<p>If the target does not share a language with the envoy, any saving throws attempted as part of the ability gains a +4 bonus.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/envoy#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
